# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo stores LF. Without this file, git on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true checks everything out as CRLF, and the next commit from
# a Linux or macOS machine rewrites all 40 files — a diff that hides the real
# change.
* text=auto

# Shell scripts must be LF whatever the platform. A CRLF shebang on Ubuntu
# fails with "/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory", which is
# one of the harder errors to recognise the first time you see it.
*.sh text eol=lf
